   151	def release_text(original, recogniser, proposal):
   152	    """SF5's two release-only rules; no slot decisions or reader votes change.
   153	
   154	    Consensus elisions survive detector absence. Existing Google elisions keep
   155	    their spelling, including on lines with real mark edits. A Google spacing
   156	    breathing is consumed atomically with attachment, else kept verbatim.
   157	    The single-source sites are observed, never promoted to consensus.
   158	    """
