The SF5 checks are complete. All 59 consensus elision atoms survive in the 56 witnesses, both doubled breathings are repaired, and the two known reader errors remain unchanged. The truth coverage matches the report: 213 positive and 5 absent sites on 180 lines, with no complete-line certification. I’m writing the report with the replay limits and out-of-scope residuals made explicit.
